Nilipiga picha kwenye hekalu.

240
00:13:47,766 --> 00:13:51,403
Ulipiga picha peke yako?

241
00:13:51,426 --> 00:13:55,760
Hapana, nilipiga picha na rafiki.

242
00:13:55,782 --> 00:13:59,549
Rafiki yako alikuwa nani?

243
00:13:59,572 --> 00:14:03,939
Rafiki yangu alikuwa Bwana John.

244
00:14:03,962 --> 00:14:07,528
Je, Bwana John pia alipiga picha?

245
00:14:07,551 --> 00:14:11,636
Ndiyo, Bwana John pia alipiga picha.

246
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:15,593
Chakula cha mchana kilikuwa nini?

247
00:14:15,616 --> 00:14:19,349
Chakula cha mchana kilikuwa samaki.

248
00:14:19,372 --> 00:14:22,815
Ulikula samaki wapi?

249
00:14:22,839 --> 00:14:26,116
Nilikula katika mgahawa wa Kyoto.

250
00:14:26,139 --> 00:14:29,554
Kulikuwa na watu kwenye mgahawa?

251
00:14:29,578 --> 00:14:33,511
Ndiyo, kulikuwa na watu kwenye mgahawa.

252
00:14:33,534 --> 00:14:37,667
Uliingia nyumbani saa ngapi?

253
00:14:37,690 --> 00:14:40,624
Niliingia nyumbani saa tatu usiku.

254
00:14:40,647 --> 00:14:43,736
Baadaye ulichofanya nini?

255
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:47,567
Baadaye nilitazama televisheni.

256
00:14:47,590 --> 00:14:50,327
Ukulala saa ngapi?

257
00:14:50,351 --> 00:14:53,122
Nilikula saa tano usiku.

258
00:14:53,146 --> 00:14:56,579
Jana juzi ulichofanya nini?

259
00:14:56,602 --> 00:15:00,069
Jana juzi ilikuwa Jumamosi.

260
00:15:00,091 --> 00:15:03,898
Je, Jumamosi ulienda Kyoto pia?

261
00:15:03,922 --> 00:15:09,174
Hapana, Jumamosi sikufanya safari popote.

262
00:15:09,198 --> 00:15:12,932
Nyumbani ulichofanya nini?

263
00:15:12,955 --> 00:15:16,571
Nyumbani nili soma Kijapani.

264
00:15:16,595 --> 00:15:19,829
Nitasoma kila siku.

265
00:15:19,852 --> 00:15:22,818
Unasoma kila siku?

266
00:15:22,841 --> 00:15:26,408
Ndio, kila siku.

267
00:15:26,431 --> 00:15:27,931
Sehemu ya 8: Kukaa na Ununuzaji / Kukawia na Ununaji

268
00:15:27,931 --> 00:15:31,498
Bwana Smith, anachelewa sana leo.

269
00:15:31,521 --> 00:15:33,758
Samahani

270
00:15:33,781 --> 00:15:38,147
Nimekaa hapa kwa saa moja tayari.

271
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:40,981
Samahani sana.

272
00:15:41,005 --> 00:15:44,886
Kuna watu wengi kwenye stesheni?

273
00:15:44,910 --> 00:15:49,343
Ndio, kulikuwa na watu wengi kwenye stesheni.

274
00:15:49,366 --> 00:15:52,766
Je, basi pia zilikuwa nyingi?

275
00:15:52,789 --> 00:15:56,767
Ndio, basi pia zilikuwa nyingi.

276
00:15:56,791 --> 00:15:59,685
Magari pia yalikuwa mengi.

277
00:15:59,708 --> 00:16:02,042
Ndio hivyo?

278
00:16:02,065 --> 00:16:06,114
Jana ulinunua vitabu vingi?

279
00:16:06,137 --> 00:16:10,904
Ndio, nilinunua vitabu vingi vya Kijapani.

280
00:16:10,927 --> 00:16:13,413
Ulinunua vitabu vingapi?

281
00:16:13,436 --> 00:16:16,170
Nilinunua vitabu vitano.

282
00:16:16,193 --> 00:16:18,770
Je, ulinunua kamusi pia?

283
00:16:18,793 --> 00:16:22,830
Ndio, nilinunua kamusi moja pia.

284
00:16:22,853 --> 00:16:27,420
Nyumbani kwa Bwana Smith kuna vitabu vingi, sivyo?

285
00:16:27,443 --> 00:16:32,111
Ndio, nyumbani kwangu kuna vitabu vingi.

286
00:16:32,134 --> 00:16:35,172
Kuna vitabu vingi vya Kiingereza pia.

287
00:16:35,196 --> 00:16:39,045
Je, una marafiki wengi?

288
00:16:39,069 --> 00:16:42,802
Ndio, nina marafiki wengi kutoka Marekani.

289
00:16:42,825 --> 00:16:46,475
Nina marafiki wengi wa Kijapani pia.

290
00:16:46,498 --> 00:16:49,970
Unasoma kwa saa ngapi kila siku?

291
00:16:49,993 --> 00:16:53,760
Nasoma kwa saa tatu kila siku.

292
00:16:53,783 --> 00:16:58,416
Saa tatu? Unasoma sana!

293
00:16:58,439 --> 00:17:02,973
Ndio, nasoma sana kila siku.

294
00:17:02,996 --> 00:17:06,482
Jana uliisoma kwa muda mrefu?

295
00:17:06,505 --> 00:17:10,958
Hapana, jana nilisoma kwa saa moja tu.

296
00:17:10,982 --> 00:17:15,193
Jana ilikuwa Jumapili.

297
00:17:15,216 --> 00:17:19,432
Ndio, Jumapili nilipumzika sana.

298
00:17:19,455 --> 00:17:20,955
Sehemu ya 9: Chakula cha Kijapani na Mafunzo

299
00:17:20,955 --> 00:17:24,989
Chakula cha Kijapani ni kitamu?

300
00:17:25,012 --> 00:17:28,945
Ndio, ni tamu sana.

301
00:17:28,968 --> 00:17:32,057
Je, sushi ni tamu?

302
00:17:32,081 --> 00:17:36,847
Ndio, sushi ni tamu sana.

303
00:17:36,870 --> 00:17:39,604
Ramen je, ni nini?

304
00:17:39,627 --> 00:17:43,093
Ramen pia ni tamu.

305
00:17:43,116 --> 00:17:46,483
Lakini ni kali kidogo.

306
00:17:46,506 --> 00:17:50,539
Je, kusoma Kijapani ni kwa kupendeza?

307
00:17:50,562 --> 00:17:56,229
Ndio, kusoma Kijapani ni kwa kupendeza sana.

308
00:17:56,253 --> 00:18:00,419
Kanji ni ngumu?

309
00:18:00,442 --> 00:18:05,076
Ndio, kanji ni ngumu sana.

310
00:18:05,099 --> 00:18:07,596
Katakana je, ni nini?

311
00:18:07,619 --> 00:18:11,019
Katakana si ngumu.

312
00:18:11,042 --> 00:18:12,877
Ni rahisi.

313
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:16,467
Je, Tokyo ni mji mzuri?

314
00:18:16,490 --> 00:18:21,657
Ndio, Tokyo ni mji mzuri sana.

315
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:24,213
Kyoto je, ni nini?

316
00:18:24,236 --> 00:18:27,570
Kyoto ni mji mzuri sana.

317
00:18:27,594 --> 00:18:30,672
Kuna mahekalu ya kale mengi.

318
00:18:30,695 --> 00:18:35,345
Shule ya Smith ni kubwa?

319
00:18:35,369 --> 00:18:40,835
Ndiyo, shule yangu ni kubwa sana.

320
00:18:40,858 --> 00:18:43,732
Darasa ni mpya?

321
00:18:43,756 --> 00:18:49,044
Ndiyo, darasa ni mpya sana.

322
00:18:49,067 --> 00:18:51,924
Mwalimu ni mkali?

323
00:18:51,948 --> 00:18:57,314
Hapana, mwalimu wangu si mkali.

324
00:18:57,337 --> 00:18:59,504
Ana upole sana.

325
00:18:59,527 --> 00:19:03,207
Nyumba ya Smith ni mpya?

326
00:19:03,230 --> 00:19:08,464
Hapana, nyumba yangu si mpya.

327
00:19:08,487 --> 00:19:10,253
Ni ya kale.

328
00:19:10,276 --> 00:19:12,843
Chumba ni pana?

329
00:19:12,866 --> 00:19:17,364
Hapana, chumba si pana.

330
00:19:17,387 --> 00:19:19,073
Ni ndogo.

331
00:19:19,097 --> 00:19:22,097
Unafanya kazi kila siku?

332
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:27,001
Ndiyo, ninafanya kazi sana kila siku.

333
00:19:27,024 --> 00:19:29,678
Leo ni joto?

334
00:19:29,702 --> 00:19:34,069
Hapana, leo si joto.

335
00:19:34,092 --> 00:19:36,337
Kuna baridi kidogo.

336
00:19:36,361 --> 00:19:37,861
Sehemu ya 10: Vitu Smith Anavyopenda

337
00:19:37,861 --> 00:19:41,794
Smith, unapenda nyama?

338
00:19:41,817 --> 00:19:46,250
Ndiyo, napenda nyama sana.

339
00:19:46,273 --> 00:19:48,707
Samaki je?

340
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:52,819
Samaki sipendi sana.

341
00:19:52,842 --> 00:19:55,609
Unapenda mboga?

342
00:19:55,632 --> 00:19:59,798
Hapana, sipendi mboga.

343
00:19:59,821 --> 00:20:03,794
Chakula unachokipenda zaidi ni kipi?

344
00:20:03,818 --> 00:20:07,252
Napenda tempura zaidi ya vyote.

345
00:20:07,275 --> 00:20:10,372
Unapenda kunywa nini?

346
00:20:10,395 --> 00:20:12,961
Napenda kahawa.

347
00:20:12,985 --> 00:20:15,418
Sipendi chai.

348
00:20:15,441 --> 00:20:18,328
Unapenda michezo gani?

349
00:20:18,352 --> 00:20:21,188
Napenda mpira wa miguu.

350
00:20:21,212 --> 00:20:23,812
Sipendi tenisi.

351
00:20:23,835 --> 00:20:27,768
Smith, unaimba vizuri?

352
00:20:27,791 --> 00:20:32,791
Hapana, siimbi vizuri.

353
00:20:32,814 --> 00:20:34,432
Naimba vibaya.

354
00:20:34,455 --> 00:20:38,289
John anaimba vizuri?

355
00:20:38,312 --> 00:20:43,446
Ndiyo, John anaimba vizuri sana.

356
00:20:43,470 --> 00:20:47,480
Smith, unapika vizuri?

357
00:20:47,503 --> 00:20:52,080
Ndiyo, napika vizuri.

358
00:20:52,104 --> 00:20:54,918
Napika kila siku.

359
00:20:54,941 --> 00:20:57,316
Ni nzuri sana!

360
00:20:57,340 --> 00:21:00,306
Unazungumza Kijapani vizuri?

361
00:21:00,329 --> 00:21:05,147
Hapana, sijazungumza Kijapani vizuri bado.

362
00:21:05,171 --> 00:21:06,744
Naimba vibaya.

363
00:21:06,767 --> 00:21:09,167
Kiingereza je?

364
00:21:09,190 --> 00:21:13,823
Kiingereza ni lugha yangu, kwa hivyo ninazungumza vizuri.

365
00:21:13,846 --> 00:21:18,013
Chakula cha mchana leo tutakula tempura.

366
00:21:18,036 --> 00:21:19,907
Sawa sana!

367
00:21:19,931 --> 00:21:22,264
Tutakula tempura.

368
00:21:22,287 --> 00:21:25,020
Twende kwenye duka lile.

369
00:21:25,043 --> 00:21:29,777
Ndiyo, twendeni madukani pale mazuri.

370
00:21:29,799 --> 00:21:32,933
Tukunywe kahawa huko pia.

371
00:21:32,956 --> 00:21:36,125
Ndiyo, tutakunywa pamoja.

372
00:21:36,149 --> 00:21:37,649
Sehemu ya 11: Misingi ya Kuonyesha Njia / Kijapani cha Msingi kwa Kuomba Mwelekeo

373
00:21:37,649 --> 00:21:39,649
Samahani

374
00:21:39,672 --> 00:21:43,284
Naomba uniambie njia kidogo.

375
00:21:43,307 --> 00:21:46,274
Ndiyo, hakuna matata.

376
00:21:46,297 --> 00:21:48,663
Unakwenda wapi?

377
00:21:48,686 --> 00:21:50,941
Ninakwenda stesheni.

378
00:21:50,965 --> 00:21:54,299
Lakini sijui njia.

379
00:21:54,323 --> 00:21:56,589
Stesheni, basi.

380
00:21:56,612 --> 00:22:00,746
Stesheni iko mbali kidogo kutoka hapa.

381
00:22:00,769 --> 00:22:03,035
Ndio hivyo?

382
00:22:03,059 --> 00:22:06,825
Sasa niko katika shida kubwa.

383
00:22:06,848 --> 00:22:11,068
Basi, angalia ramani hii ya zamani.

384
00:22:11,091 --> 00:22:13,825
Ndiyo, nitaangalia.

385
00:22:13,848 --> 00:22:18,022
Sisi sasa tuko hapa.

386
00:22:18,046 --> 00:22:20,123
Huko, basi.

387
00:22:20,147 --> 00:22:22,313
Sawa, nimeelewa.

388
00:22:22,336 --> 00:22:26,870
Kwanza, endelea moja kwa moja kwenye njia hii.

389
00:22:26,893 --> 00:22:29,459
Nitaenda moja kwa moja.

390
00:22:29,482 --> 00:22:35,020
Kisha, pinda kulia kwenye pambizo kubwa pale.

391
00:22:35,044 --> 00:22:37,423
Kulia, basi.

392
00:22:37,447 --> 00:22:42,256
Ee, kuna benki ya zamani pale.

393
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:45,613
Je, ni jengo jeupe pale?

394
00:22:45,636 --> 00:22:49,769
Hapana, ni jengo la buluu.

395
00:22:49,792 --> 00:22:51,769
Sawa, nimeelewa.

396
00:22:51,792 --> 00:22:56,359
Karibu na benki kuna duka kubwa jipya.

397
00:22:56,382 --> 00:22:58,551
Duka, basi?

398
00:22:58,575 --> 00:23:03,708
Ee, mbele ya duka kuna kituo cha basi.

399
00:23:03,731 --> 00:23:05,946
Kituo cha basi, basi.

400
00:23:05,970 --> 00:23:11,171
Ndiyo, panda basi la kwanza kutoka huko.

401
00:23:11,194 --> 00:23:13,995
Basi la kwanza, basi.

402
00:23:14,018 --> 00:23:19,194
Basi hilo linaelekea stesheni, ni rahisi sana.

403
00:23:19,217 --> 00:23:21,684
Basi itachukua dakika ngapi?

404
00:23:21,707 --> 00:23:24,722
Dakika tano hivi.

405
00:23:24,745 --> 00:23:28,145
Ni karibu, utafika haraka.

406
00:23:28,168 --> 00:23:30,001
Sawa, nzuri.

407
00:23:30,024 --> 00:23:31,827
Nimefarijika.

408
00:23:31,850 --> 00:23:37,417
Leo ni joto sana, kunywa maji mengi.

409
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:39,929
Ndiyo, nitakunywa.

410
00:23:39,953 --> 00:23:43,519
Enda kwa uangalifu.

411
00:23:43,542 --> 00:23:46,996
Asante sana.

412
00:23:47,019 --> 00:23:48,519
Sehemu ya 12: Mazungumzo ya Kuomba Ruhusa / Kuomba Ruhusa katika Mazungumzo

413
00:23:48,519 --> 00:23:50,519
Samahani

414
00:23:50,542 --> 00:23:54,216
Naomba nipige picha hapa?

415
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:59,131
Hapana, hapana ruhusa ya kupiga picha hapa.

416
00:23:59,154 --> 00:24:02,001
Aa, ndivyo?

417
00:24:02,024 --> 00:24:04,191
Kwa nini?

418
00:24:04,214 --> 00:24:10,014
Kuna picha nyingi za zamani hapa.

419
00:24:10,037 --> 00:24:11,672
Sawa, nimeelewa.

420
00:24:11,696 --> 00:24:15,729
Basi, naomba ningie pale?

421
00:24:15,752 --> 00:24:20,559
Hapana, hapana ruhusa ya kuingia pale.

422
00:24:20,582 --> 00:24:23,116
Hata pale siwezi?

423
00:24:23,139 --> 00:24:29,139
Ee, pale ni chumba cha mkurugenzi wa kampuni.

424
00:24:29,162 --> 00:24:30,775
Sawa, nimeelewa.

425
00:24:30,798 --> 00:24:35,031
Basi, naweza kupumzika wapi?

426
00:24:35,054 --> 00:24:38,343
Chumba cha mapumziko kiko huko.

427
00:24:38,366 --> 00:24:41,933
Unaweza kuvuta sigara huko.

428
00:24:41,956 --> 00:24:44,589
Naweza kunywa chai?

429
00:24:44,612 --> 00:24:46,281
Ndiyo.

430
00:24:46,305 --> 00:24:49,601
Chai na juisi zote ni salama.

431
00:24:49,625 --> 00:24:51,960
Kuna nyingi sana.

432
00:24:51,983 --> 00:24:54,117
Vizuri sana.

433
00:24:54,140 --> 00:24:57,475
Naweza kutumia kompyuta hii?

434
00:24:57,498 --> 00:25:02,965
Hapana, usitumie kompyuta hiyo.

435
00:25:02,988 --> 00:25:05,562
Kompyuta ya nani hii?

436
00:25:05,585 --> 00:25:08,852
Ni kompyuta ya Tanaka.

437
00:25:08,875 --> 00:25:11,441
Usiguse.

438
00:25:11,464 --> 00:25:13,300
Sawa, nimeelewa.

439
00:25:13,324 --> 00:25:17,691
Je, naweza kutazama simu yangu?

440
00:25:17,714 --> 00:25:19,450
Ndiyo.

441
00:25:19,473 --> 00:25:22,307
Simu ni sawa.

442
00:25:22,330 --> 00:25:24,426
Sawa, nzuri.

443
00:25:24,449 --> 00:25:29,699
Hawatakiwi kucheza wakati wa kazi.

444
00:25:29,723 --> 00:25:32,332
Sawa, nimeelewa.

445
00:25:32,356 --> 00:25:34,189
Nitakuwa makini.

446
00:25:34,212 --> 00:25:39,079
Basi, njoo chumbani pale saa sita.

447
00:25:39,102 --> 00:25:41,768
Sawa, nimeelewa.

448
00:25:41,791 --> 00:25:44,358
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

449
00:25:44,381 --> 00:25:45,881
Mstari wa 13: Mazungumzo ya Simu

450
00:25:45,881 --> 00:25:50,097
Halo, unafanya nini sasa?

451
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:55,559
Halo, sasa niko nyumbani nikisikiliza muziki.

452
00:25:55,582 --> 00:25:57,228
Nzuri.

453
00:25:57,251 --> 00:26:00,385
Unausikiliza muziki wa aina gani?

454
00:26:00,408 --> 00:26:04,492
Ninasikiliza nyimbo za kale za Kijapani.

455
00:26:04,515 --> 00:26:06,281
Ndiyo hivyo.

456
00:26:06,304 --> 00:26:09,271
Umekula chakula tayari?

457
00:26:09,294 --> 00:26:11,061
Ndiyo.

458
00:26:11,084 --> 00:26:14,284
Nimekula bento kidogo kwanza.

459
00:26:14,307 --> 00:26:17,164
Leo umekwenda mahali popote?

460
00:26:17,187 --> 00:26:19,254
Eeh.

461
00:26:19,277 --> 00:26:24,526
Leo kuna mvua, kwa hiyo niko nyumbani tu.

462
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:26,124
Ndiyo hivyo.

463
00:26:26,147 --> 00:26:29,514
Mark anafanya nini sasa?

464
00:26:29,537 --> 00:26:34,580
Mark sasa analala chumbani jirani.

465
00:26:34,603 --> 00:26:37,471
Ameshalala tayari?

466
00:26:37,494 --> 00:26:39,694
Mapema sana.

467
00:26:39,717 --> 00:26:41,650
Ndiyo.

468
00:26:41,673 --> 00:26:47,807
Leo tangu asubuhi amefanya kazi nyingi, kwa hiyo amechoka sana.

469
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:49,763
Ndiyo.

470
00:26:49,786 --> 00:26:52,953
Kesho ataamka saa ngapi?

471
00:26:52,976 --> 00:26:56,619
Kesho nitaamka saa kumi na mbili asubuhi.

472
00:26:56,642 --> 00:26:59,128
Mapema sana asubuhi.

473
00:26:59,151 --> 00:27:01,318
Kesho pia kazi?

474
00:27:01,341 --> 00:27:03,189
Ndiyo.

475
00:27:03,212 --> 00:27:06,745
Kesho pia nina kazi asubuhi.

476
00:27:06,768 --> 00:27:09,035
Ni ngumu.

477
00:27:09,058 --> 00:27:12,591
Sasa nje bado mvua inanyesha?

478
00:27:12,614 --> 00:27:14,448
Ndiyo.

479
00:27:14,471 --> 00:27:17,743
Bado inanyesha sana.

480
00:27:17,767 --> 00:27:20,007
Upepo pia ni mkali.

481
00:27:20,030 --> 00:27:23,438
Basi, hawatakuwa na safari.

482
00:27:23,461 --> 00:27:25,529
Ndiyo hivyo.

483
00:27:25,553 --> 00:27:29,489
Kwa hiyo, niko nyumbani nikisoma kitabu.

484
00:27:29,512 --> 00:27:32,712
Unasoma kitabu cha nini?

485
00:27:32,735 --> 00:27:36,668
Ninasoma kitabu cha kujifunza Kijapani.

486
00:27:36,691 --> 00:27:38,225
Umefanya vizuri sana!

487
00:27:38,248 --> 00:27:41,281
Mwendelee kusoma kwa bidii, ndiyo?

488
00:27:41,304 --> 00:27:42,798
Asante.

489
00:27:42,822 --> 00:27:45,355
Nitakuwasiliana tena.

490
00:27:45,378 --> 00:27:46,878
Mlo 14: Kuzungumzia Familia Yangu

491
00:27:46,878 --> 00:27:50,568
Hii ni picha ya nani?

492
00:27:50,591 --> 00:27:55,225
Hii ni picha ya familia yangu.

493
00:27:55,248 --> 00:27:58,663
Waa, picha nzuri sana!

494
00:27:58,686 --> 00:28:01,886
Familia yako ina watu wangapi?

495
00:28:01,909 --> 00:28:05,320
Tuna watu wanne katika familia.

496
00:28:05,344 --> 00:28:09,184
Nina mke na watoto wawili.

497
00:28:09,207 --> 00:28:13,090
Yule mrefu ni nani?

498
00:28:13,114 --> 00:28:16,880
Yule ni mwanangu.

499
00:28:16,903 --> 00:28:20,270
Mwanao ana macho makubwa sana!

500
00:28:20,293 --> 00:28:25,582
Ndiyo, mwanangu ana nywele ndefu.

501
00:28:25,606 --> 00:28:29,139
Pia ana sauti nzuri sana kwa kuimba.

502
00:28:29,162 --> 00:28:31,261
Nzuri.

503
00:28:31,285 --> 00:28:35,485
Yule msichana mzuri ni nani?

504
00:28:35,508 --> 00:28:39,041
Yule ni binti yangu.

505
00:28:39,064 --> 00:28:42,731
Binti yangu ana umri wa miaka sita mwaka huu.

506
00:28:42,754 --> 00:28:46,587
Binti yako ana mikono midogo sana!

507
00:28:46,610 --> 00:28:52,856
Ndiyo. Sasa anakwenda shuleni kila siku.

508
00:28:52,879 --> 00:28:55,246
Kila siku?

509
00:28:55,269 --> 00:28:58,436
Inaonekana kuwa na shughuli nyingi!

510
00:28:58,459 --> 00:29:02,592
Ndiyo. Kila siku tuna shughuli nyingi sana.

511
00:29:02,615 --> 00:29:05,548
Mkeo yuko wapi?

512
00:29:05,571 --> 00:29:09,771
Mke wangu ni yule kwenye upande wa kulia.

513
00:29:09,794 --> 00:29:13,128
Mkeo ni mtu mwenye utulivu?

514
00:29:13,152 --> 00:29:17,620
Hapana, mke wangu anaongea kwa muda mrefu.

515
00:29:17,643 --> 00:29:20,416
Yeye ni mtu mwenye nguvu sana.

516
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:24,687
Familia yenu inaonekana kuwa ya furaha sana!

517
00:29:24,711 --> 00:29:30,111
Ndiyo. Kila mtu katika familia yangu anapenda kamera.

518
00:29:30,134 --> 00:29:34,753
Kwa hiyo, mna picha nzuri nyingi!

519
00:29:34,777 --> 00:29:38,629
Ndiyo. Tunachukua picha kila siku.

520
00:29:38,652 --> 00:29:41,300
Ninawashangaa!

521
00:29:41,324 --> 00:29:45,793
Familia yangu sasa iko Vietnam.

522
00:29:45,816 --> 00:29:49,817
Vipi, ni huzuni.

523
00:29:49,841 --> 00:29:55,379
Ndiyo. Lakini tunazungumza kwa simu kila siku.

524
00:29:55,402 --> 00:29:56,902
Mlo 15: Kupiga Picha Siku ya Jumapili

525
00:29:56,902 --> 00:30:01,195
Una mpango gani kwa Jumapili ijayo?

526
00:30:01,219 --> 00:30:07,785
Jumapili ijayo nitakwenda bustanini kupiga picha.

527
00:30:07,808 --> 00:30:09,688
Bustani?

528
00:30:09,712 --> 00:30:11,545
Sawa sana!

529
00:30:11,568 --> 00:30:14,207
Ni bustani ipi?

530
00:30:14,230 --> 00:30:19,564
Ni bustani kubwa iliyo katikati ya mji.

531
00:30:19,587 --> 00:30:24,323
Pale ni tulivu na nzuri, ni nzuri sana.

532
00:30:24,346 --> 00:30:31,512
Ndiyo. Jumapili ijayo itakuwa na hali ya hewa nzuri na baridi.

533
00:30:31,535 --> 00:30:34,735
Utaenda na nani?

534
00:30:34,758 --> 00:30:38,958
Nitakwenda na rafiki yangu Mark.

535
00:30:38,981 --> 00:30:42,348
Mark pia ana kamera?

536
00:30:42,371 --> 00:30:43,841
Ndiyo.

537
00:30:43,865 --> 00:30:49,398
Mark amewanunua kamera mpya na kubwa.

538
00:30:49,421 --> 00:30:51,621
Ndio hivyo?

539
00:30:51,644 --> 00:30:55,577
Mimi pia ningependa kwenda bustani hiyo.

540
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:59,055
Basi, twende pamoja.

541
00:30:59,079 --> 00:31:01,116
Sawa?

542
00:31:01,140 --> 00:31:03,173
Ninafurahi sana.

543
00:31:03,196 --> 00:31:08,196
Tukutane mbele ya stesheni saa tatu asubuhi siku ya Jumapili.

544
00:31:08,219 --> 00:31:10,287
Sawa, nimeelewa.

545
00:31:10,311 --> 00:31:13,154
Utaenda stesheni kwa nini?

546
00:31:13,178 --> 00:31:16,311
Mimi nitaenda kwa baiskeli.

547
00:31:16,334 --> 00:31:19,067
Stesheni iko karibu.

548
00:31:19,090 --> 00:31:21,890
Mimi nitaenda kwa basi.

549
00:31:21,913 --> 00:31:26,280
Basi ni rahisi na bei nafuu, ni nzuri.

550
00:31:26,303 --> 00:31:27,936
Ndiyo.

551
00:31:27,959 --> 00:31:32,560
Kuna mgahawa mzuri karibu na bustani?

552
00:31:32,584 --> 00:31:34,455
Ndiyo.

553
00:31:34,478 --> 00:31:39,812
Kuna mgahawa mpya na mzuri mbele ya bustani.

554
00:31:39,835 --> 00:31:43,235
Mpya na ya kale?

555
00:31:43,258 --> 00:31:45,858
Inaonekana ya kustaajabisha.

556
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:50,337
Karai yao ni bei nafuu na ladha nzuri.

557
00:31:50,361 --> 00:31:55,100
Basi, chakula cha mchana tutakula huko.

558
00:31:55,123 --> 00:31:57,923
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

559
00:31:57,946 --> 00:32:00,439
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

560
00:32:00,462 --> 00:32:01,962
Sehemu ya 16: Maoni kuhusu Filamu

561
00:32:01,962 --> 00:32:06,035
Jana nilitazama filamu mpya.

562
00:32:06,059 --> 00:32:07,711
Ndio hivyo?

563
00:32:07,734 --> 00:32:10,703
Ulitazama filamu gani?

564
00:32:10,727 --> 00:32:14,460
Filamu ya katuni maarufu.

565
00:32:14,483 --> 00:32:17,516
Aa, filamu hiyo.

566
00:32:17,539 --> 00:32:19,673
Ilikuaje?

567
00:32:19,696 --> 00:32:25,096
Nadhani filamu hiyo ilikuwa ndefu kidogo.

568
00:32:25,119 --> 00:32:28,552
Ilikuwa ndefu kwa muda gani?

569
00:32:28,575 --> 00:32:31,387
Ilikuwa na saa tatu hivi.

570
00:32:31,410 --> 00:32:33,943
Nilichoka sana.

571
00:32:33,966 --> 00:32:37,500
Saa tatu ni ndefu.

572
00:32:37,523 --> 00:32:39,894
Ilikuwa ya kuvutia?

573
00:32:39,917 --> 00:32:45,410
Hmm, nadhani haikuwa ya kuvutia sana.

574
00:32:45,434 --> 00:32:48,116
Aa, ni hivyo?

575
00:32:48,139 --> 00:32:51,306
Kwa nini haikuwa ya kuvutia?

576
00:32:51,329 --> 00:32:55,147
Hadithi ilikuwa ngumu kidogo.

577
00:32:55,170 --> 00:32:57,805
Sikuelewa vizuri.

578
00:32:57,829 --> 00:32:59,862
Nimeelewa.

579
00:32:59,885 --> 00:33:03,485
Watoto wangeelewa hadithi hiyo kwa ugumu?

580
00:33:03,508 --> 00:33:04,975
Ndiyo.

581
00:33:04,998 --> 00:33:08,731
Nadhani watoto wangeona ngumu sana.

582
00:33:08,754 --> 00:33:11,572
Muziki ulikuaje?

583
00:33:11,595 --> 00:33:15,962
Nadhani muziki ulikuwa mzuri sana na wa kuvutia.

584
00:33:15,985 --> 00:33:19,672
Muziki mzuri ni nzuri.

585
00:33:19,696 --> 00:33:24,496
Ndiyo, lakini viti vya sinema vilikuwa vigumu.

586
00:33:24,519 --> 00:33:27,285
Hiyo ilikuwa ngumu.

587
00:33:27,308 --> 00:33:30,316
Kumbe unaumwa tako?

588
00:33:30,339 --> 00:33:31,906
Ndiyo.

589
00:33:31,929 --> 00:33:35,227
Tako zangu ziliuma sana.

590
00:33:35,251 --> 00:33:40,231
Kwa hiyo saa tatu zilionekana kuwa zaidi.

591
00:33:40,254 --> 00:33:42,331
Ndiyo.

592
00:33:42,355 --> 00:33:45,208
Niliongea usingizi katikati.

593
00:33:45,231 --> 00:33:48,664
Sinema huwa ni giza.

594
00:33:48,687 --> 00:33:51,721
Mimi pia mara nyingi naona usingizi.

595
00:33:51,744 --> 00:33:55,977
Lakini nilijaribu kwa bidii mpaka mwisho.

596
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,835
Umefanya vizuri sana!

597
00:33:57,858 --> 00:34:01,392
Rafiki yako alisema nini?

598
00:34:01,415 --> 00:34:06,248
Rafiki yangu alisema ilikuwa ya kufurahisha sana.

599
00:34:06,271 --> 00:34:09,889
Watu wana maoni tofauti, kweli?

600
00:34:09,913 --> 00:34:15,648
Ndiyo, rafiki yangu alisema atakuja kuutazama tena wiki ijayo.

601
00:34:15,671 --> 00:34:17,766
Kweli?

602
00:34:17,790 --> 00:34:20,556
Amependea sana basi!

603
00:34:20,579 --> 00:34:22,227
Ndiyo.

604
00:34:22,250 --> 00:34:25,653
Mimi siwezi kusema nitakutazama tena.

605
00:34:25,677 --> 00:34:29,810
Filamu ijayo inabidi iwe fupi kidogo.

606
00:34:29,833 --> 00:34:31,466
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

607
00:34:31,489 --> 00:34:36,130
Mimi ningependa kutazama filamu ya vichekesho yenye furaha ijayo.

608
00:34:36,154 --> 00:34:38,233
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

609
00:34:38,256 --> 00:34:41,789
Mimi pia ningependa kuja pamoja nawe wakati ujao.

610
00:34:41,812 --> 00:34:43,312
Mstari wa 17: Maandalizi ya Mkutano na Shughuli

611
00:34:43,312 --> 00:34:47,769
Umemwona Bwana Mark leo?

612
00:34:47,792 --> 00:34:51,827
Hapana, sijamwona leo bado.

613
00:34:51,851 --> 00:34:54,339
Kuna jambo fulani?

614
00:34:54,362 --> 00:35:01,530
Bwana Mark alisema hatakuweza kuja hapa kesho.

615
00:35:01,553 --> 00:35:05,287
Aisee, hatakuja kesho?

616
00:35:05,310 --> 00:35:07,243
Kwa nini?

617
00:35:07,266 --> 00:35:14,204
Alisema kuwa kesho atakuwa na kazi muhimu asubuhi.

618
00:35:14,227 --> 00:35:16,161
Ndio hivyo?

619
00:35:16,184 --> 00:35:19,584
Tutafanyaje na mkutano wa kesho?

620
00:35:19,607 --> 00:35:25,740
Alisema atatengeneza hati za mkutano leo.

621
00:35:25,763 --> 00:35:28,412
Hiyo inafurahisha kusikia.

622
00:35:28,435 --> 00:35:32,269
Bwana Mark yuko wapi sasa?

623
00:35:32,292 --> 00:35:37,058
Sasa yuko chumbani kingine akifanya kazi.

624
00:35:37,081 --> 00:35:38,781
Sawa, nimeelewa.

625
00:35:38,804 --> 00:35:41,061
Nitamwendea baadaye.

626
00:35:41,084 --> 00:35:46,918
Aa, na aliacha ujumbe.

627
00:35:46,941 --> 00:35:49,074
Ujumbe gani?

628
00:35:49,097 --> 00:35:54,264
Alisema amemrudishia Bwana Tanaka kitabu.

629
00:35:54,287 --> 00:35:56,087
Kitabu?

630
00:35:56,110 --> 00:35:58,477
Kitabu gani?

631
00:35:58,500 --> 00:36:02,466
Alisema ni kamusi ya Kijapani.

632
00:36:02,489 --> 00:36:04,124
Sawa, nimeelewa.

633
00:36:04,147 --> 00:36:06,590
Nitamwambia Bwana Tanaka.

634
00:36:06,614 --> 00:36:08,694
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

635
00:36:08,718 --> 00:36:12,685
Bwana Mark alikuwa na haraka sana.

636
00:36:12,708 --> 00:36:15,741
Anasonga maandalizi ya kazi.

637
00:36:15,764 --> 00:36:22,036
Hapana, alisema wiki hii yote amekuwa mzigo sana.

638
00:36:22,059 --> 00:36:25,116
Afya yake iko sawa?

639
00:36:25,140 --> 00:36:26,550
Ninahangaika.

640
00:36:26,574 --> 00:36:32,857
Alisema hulala vizuri kila usiku, hivyo yuko sawa.

641
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:35,485
Nimefurahi kusikia hiyo.

642
00:36:35,509 --> 00:36:41,043
Alisema atakuja mapema Jumatatu ijayo.

643
00:36:41,066 --> 00:36:42,866
Sawa, nimeelewa.

644
00:36:42,889 --> 00:36:45,364
Tutazungumza tena Jumatatu.

645
00:36:45,387 --> 00:36:46,847
Ndiyo.

646
00:36:46,871 --> 00:36:49,204
Ujumbe ni huo tu.

647
00:36:49,227 --> 00:36:51,828
Asante kwa kunijulisha.

648
00:36:51,852 --> 00:36:56,866
Karibu, nitakujulisha kama kuna jambo lolote.

649
00:36:56,889 --> 00:36:58,123
Ndiyo.

650
00:36:58,146 --> 00:37:00,346
Tafadhali, ninaomba.

651
00:37:00,369 --> 00:37:01,869
Mstari wa 18: Mapenzi na Upishi

652
00:37:01,869 --> 00:37:05,202
Mapenzi yako ni nini?

653
00:37:05,225 --> 00:37:09,431
Mapenzi yangu ni kupika chakula.

654
00:37:09,454 --> 00:37:12,254
Utabiri? Nzuri sana!

655
00:37:12,277 --> 00:37:14,765
Unawapika kila siku?

656
00:37:14,789 --> 00:37:16,189
Ndiyo.

657
00:37:16,212 --> 00:37:20,480
Napenda sana kupika chakula.

658
00:37:20,503 --> 00:37:23,508
Unawapika vyakula gani mara nyingi?

659
00:37:23,531 --> 00:37:26,777
Nawapika vyakula vya Kijapani mara nyingi.

660
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:29,488
Nikuze nikapike nyama na jageti.

661
00:37:29,512 --> 00:37:32,245
Eeh, nyama na jageti?

662
00:37:32,268 --> 00:37:34,285
Ningependa nijionee.

663
00:37:34,309 --> 00:37:38,475
Je, siku hizi tutafanya karamu nyumbani kwangu?

664
00:37:38,498 --> 00:37:40,349
Sawa sana!

665
00:37:40,373 --> 00:37:42,464
Ningependa sana kuja.

666
00:37:42,488 --> 00:37:45,126
Mapenzi yako ni nini?

667
00:37:45,149 --> 00:37:49,116
Napenda kuimba nyimbo.

668
00:37:49,139 --> 00:37:52,106
Kuimba? Nzuri sana!

669
00:37:52,129 --> 00:37:54,462
Unaimba wapi?

670
00:37:54,485 --> 00:37:57,652
Mara nyingi naenda karaoke kuimba.

671
00:37:57,674 --> 00:38:00,679
Mark alikuwa anasema.

672
00:38:00,703 --> 00:38:03,937
Mark alikuwa anasema nini?

673
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:07,960
Unaimba vizuri sana.

674
00:38:07,982 --> 00:38:11,749
Aa, Mark alisema hivyo?

675
00:38:11,773 --> 00:38:13,707
Nashindwa na aibu.

676
00:38:13,730 --> 00:38:17,096
Tafadhali imba katika karamu yetu ijayo.

677
00:38:17,119 --> 00:38:18,815
Sawa, nimeelewa.

678
00:38:18,839 --> 00:38:20,973
Nitaimba kidogo tu.

679
00:38:20,996 --> 00:38:23,238
Ninangoja kwa hamu.

680
00:38:23,262 --> 00:38:26,495
Nitapika chakula kingi.

681
00:38:26,518 --> 00:38:30,764
Napenda kununua vitamu, kwa hiyo nitakileta.

682
00:38:30,788 --> 00:38:32,388
Asante sana.

683
00:38:32,411 --> 00:38:35,218
Napenda sana vyakula vyenye sukari.

684
00:38:35,242 --> 00:38:37,724
Tumwite Mark pia.

685
00:38:37,747 --> 00:38:42,747
Ndiyo. Mark anapiga gitaa vizuri sana.

686
00:38:42,770 --> 00:38:44,637
Kweli?

687
00:38:44,660 --> 00:38:47,831
Tutapata furaha na muziki pamoja.

688
00:38:47,855 --> 00:38:52,221
Ndiyo. Itakuwa karamu yenye shangwe.

689
00:38:52,244 --> 00:38:55,178
Ninangoja Jumapili kwa hamu sana.

690
00:38:55,201 --> 00:38:58,860
Ndiyo, tunakungoja Jumapili.

691
00:38:58,883 --> 00:39:00,383
Mlo 19: Mapumziko ya Dukani kwa Siku ya Joto / Mapumziko ya Dukani kwa Siku ya Joto

692
00:39:00,383 --> 00:39:04,552
Eeh, nimekutembea kidogo.

693
00:39:04,575 --> 00:39:07,184
Nimechoka.

694
00:39:07,208 --> 00:39:09,341
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

695
00:39:09,364 --> 00:39:13,498
Sasa nje ni joto sana.

696
00:39:13,521 --> 00:39:16,754
Kinywa changu kimekauka.

697
00:39:16,777 --> 00:39:18,311
Ndiyo.

698
00:39:18,334 --> 00:39:21,701
Kuna duka la bidhaa pale.

699
00:39:21,724 --> 00:39:25,217
Je, utanunua kitu chochote kwenye duka hilo?

700
00:39:25,241 --> 00:39:29,274
Ningependa kununua chai baridi.

701
00:39:29,297 --> 00:39:31,130
Sawa sana!

702
00:39:31,153 --> 00:39:34,753
Napenda kunywa maji ya soda.

703
00:39:34,776 --> 00:39:38,710
Je, utanunua kitu cha kula?

704
00:39:38,733 --> 00:39:44,466
Sasa nina shiba, kwa hiyo sitahitaji chochote.

705
00:39:44,489 --> 00:39:46,061
Ndio hivyo?

706
00:39:46,084 --> 00:39:50,151
Mimi nina njaa kidogo.

707
00:39:50,174 --> 00:39:54,189
Basi, nunua mchele ulioshikwa au kitu kama hicho.

708
00:39:54,213 --> 00:39:56,946
Ndiyo, nitakunywa.

709
00:39:56,969 --> 00:40:00,010
Napenda mchele ulioshikwa wa samaki.

710
00:40:00,033 --> 00:40:03,800
Aiskrimu ya dukani hii ni nzuri sana.

711
00:40:03,823 --> 00:40:06,637
Aiskrimu?

712
00:40:06,660 --> 00:40:08,794
Sawa sana!

713
00:40:08,817 --> 00:40:13,883
Lakini sasa ni vyema nisiwe na kitu chochote cha kula?

714
00:40:13,906 --> 00:40:15,963
Kwa nini?

715
00:40:15,987 --> 00:40:20,405
Saa ni moja tu hadi saa ya chakula cha jioni.

716
00:40:20,429 --> 00:40:23,965
Aa, nimek忘れta.

717
00:40:23,988 --> 00:40:27,885
Basi, tutaacha onigiri.

718
00:40:27,908 --> 00:40:31,642
Ee, tutakunywa kinywaji tu.

719
00:40:31,665 --> 00:40:33,431
Sawa, nimeelewa.

720
00:40:33,454 --> 00:40:36,462
Tununue kinywaji baridi.

721
00:40:36,486 --> 00:40:39,720
Pesa nitakulipa mimi.

722
00:40:39,743 --> 00:40:42,543
Eeh, haina shida?

723
00:40:42,566 --> 00:40:43,932
Samahani

724
00:40:43,955 --> 00:40:49,591
Kila mara unanisaidia, hii ni kidogo tu.

725
00:40:49,614 --> 00:40:51,548
Asante sana.

726
00:40:51,571 --> 00:40:54,704
Basi, nitakupikia chai.

727
00:40:54,727 --> 00:40:58,961
Sawa, basi tuingie dukani.

728
00:40:58,985 --> 00:41:02,830
Ndani ya duka ni baridi sana, sivyo?

729
00:41:02,853 --> 00:41:05,292
Ndiyo, kweli.

730
00:41:05,315 --> 00:41:07,849
Sipendi kutoka hapa.

731
00:41:07,873 --> 00:41:11,040
Vikapu viko wapi?

732
00:41:11,063 --> 00:41:14,396
Viko karibu na ingresso.

733
00:41:14,419 --> 00:41:16,186
Sawa, nimeelewa.

734
00:41:16,209 --> 00:41:18,142
Nitakwenda kuyatafuta.

735
00:41:18,165 --> 00:41:19,665
Mandhari 20: Kumbukumbu za Safari

736
00:41:19,665 --> 00:41:23,520
Safari ya wiki iliyopita ilikuaje?

737
00:41:23,543 --> 00:41:28,758
Safari ya wiki iliyopita ilikuwa ya furaha sana.

738
00:41:28,782 --> 00:41:31,315
Ulienda wapi?

739
00:41:31,338 --> 00:41:34,378
Nilienda Hokkaido.

740
00:41:34,401 --> 00:41:36,635
Nilienda mara ya kwanza.

741
00:41:36,658 --> 00:41:40,265
Eeh, Hokkaido.

742
00:41:40,288 --> 00:41:42,466
Hakukuwa na baridi sana?

743
00:41:42,490 --> 00:41:47,144
Baridi kidogo tu, ilikuwa nzuri.

744
00:41:47,167 --> 00:41:49,900
Kila siku hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri.

745
00:41:49,923 --> 00:41:52,656
Hiyo ni nzuri.

746
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:55,134
Ulikula nini?

747
00:41:55,157 --> 00:41:59,003
Nilikula sushi nyingi.

748
00:41:59,027 --> 00:42:01,227
Ilikuwa tamu sana.

749
00:42:01,250 --> 00:42:06,283
Nzuri sana, na mimi ninataka kula sushi.

750
00:42:06,306 --> 00:42:11,573
Samaki ulikuwa mpya, haina harufu kabisa.

751
00:42:11,597 --> 00:42:14,130
Ulikula ramen?

752
00:42:14,153 --> 00:42:15,920
Ndiyo.

753
00:42:15,943 --> 00:42:19,425
Usiku nilikula ramen ya miso.

754
00:42:19,448 --> 00:42:21,300
Nilikua na joto.

755
00:42:21,323 --> 00:42:24,732
Gharama za safari zilikuwa ghali?

756
00:42:24,755 --> 00:42:29,957
Ndege ilikuwa ghali kidogo, lakini hoteli ilikuwa rahisi.

757
00:42:29,981 --> 00:42:33,215
Hoteli ilikuwa safi?

758
00:42:33,239 --> 00:42:34,617
Ndiyo.

759
00:42:34,640 --> 00:42:39,007
Ilikuwa mpya na safi sana.

760
00:42:39,030 --> 00:42:42,196
Ulienda mahali pa utalii popote?

761
00:42:42,219 --> 00:42:45,953
Nilienda kuona ziwa kubwa.

762
00:42:45,975 --> 00:42:48,811
Ilikuwa tulivu na safi.

763
00:42:48,835 --> 00:42:51,568
Ulichukua picha nyingi?

764
00:42:51,591 --> 00:42:55,724
Nimechukua picha zaidi ya mia moja kwa simu yangu.

765
00:42:55,747 --> 00:42:57,714
Baadaye nitakuonyesha.

766
00:42:57,737 --> 00:42:59,304
Asante.

767
00:42:59,327 --> 00:43:02,369
Ulinunua zawadi yoyote?

768
00:43:02,393 --> 00:43:06,126
Nilinunua biskuti tamu.

769
00:43:06,149 --> 00:43:08,765
Hii ni zawadi yako.

770
00:43:08,789 --> 00:43:11,643
Waa, asante.

771
00:43:11,666 --> 00:43:14,033
Ninashangaa sana.

772
00:43:14,056 --> 00:43:20,235
Safari ilikuwa nzuri, lakini safari ilikuwa ndefu na nimechoka.

773
00:43:20,258 --> 00:43:23,534
Ulikula saa ngapi kwenye ndege?

774
00:43:23,557 --> 00:43:27,575
Kutoka Tokyo, ilichukua saa mbili hivi.

775
00:43:27,599 --> 00:43:31,011
Saa mbili ni kidogo ndefu, sivyo?

776
00:43:31,034 --> 00:43:34,434
Lakini, ilikuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.

777
00:43:34,457 --> 00:43:36,352
Ndiyo.

778
00:43:36,376 --> 00:43:40,778
Ilikuwa nzuri sana, naomba tupate kwenda tena.

779
00:43:40,801 --> 00:43:44,286
Mimi pia ningependa kwenda pamoja next time.

780
00:43:44,310 --> 00:43:45,946
Nzuri.

781
00:43:45,970 --> 00:43:49,770
Ulisema Hokkaido ni nzuri sana wakati wa baridi.

782
00:43:49,793 --> 00:43:53,526
Basi, tutaenda wakati wa baridi next time.

783
00:43:53,549 --> 00:43:55,049
Mstari wa 21: Utangulizi wa Mwalimu Mpya

784
00:43:55,049 --> 00:44:00,703
Yule anayesoma kitabu pale ni nani?

785
00:44:00,726 --> 00:44:05,304
Aa, yule karibu na dirisha?

786
00:44:05,328 --> 00:44:10,895
Ndiyo, yule aliyevaa kofia nyeusi.

787
00:44:10,918 --> 00:44:16,285
Yule ni mwalimu mpya aliyefika wiki iliyopita.

788
00:44:16,308 --> 00:44:18,341
Ndio hivyo?

789
00:44:18,364 --> 00:44:21,810
Jina lake ni nani?

790
00:44:21,834 --> 00:44:25,067
Anaitwa Mwalimu Tanaka.

791
00:44:25,090 --> 00:44:30,773
Mwalimu Tanaka? Anafundisha nini?

792
00:44:30,797 --> 00:44:35,205
Anafundisha historia ya Japani.

793
00:44:35,228 --> 00:44:38,897
Aha, mwalimu wa historia?

794
00:44:38,920 --> 00:44:41,054
Anaonekana kijana.

795
00:44:41,077 --> 00:44:48,810
Ndiyo, watu waliongea naye jana walisema ni mpole sana.

796
00:44:48,833 --> 00:44:51,306
Hiyo ni nzuri.

797
00:44:51,329 --> 00:44:54,342
Ningependa pia kuongea naye.

798
00:44:54,366 --> 00:44:59,808
Kitabu ambacho mwalimu anakisoma ni cha nini?

799
00:44:59,832 --> 00:45:03,065
Kitabu hicho ni kikubwa sana.

800
00:45:03,088 --> 00:45:05,421
Je, ni kamusi?

801
00:45:05,444 --> 00:45:11,616
Hapana, ni kitabu chenye picha nyingi za zamani.

802
00:45:11,640 --> 00:45:15,976
Aa, mwalimu anahamia chumba cha karibu.

803
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:20,267
Anaonekana anaongea na mwalimu mwingine pale.

804
00:45:20,290 --> 00:45:24,103
Mfuko alionao pia ni mzuri.

805
00:45:24,126 --> 00:45:29,726
Ndiyo, alisema alinunua mfuko huo Kyoto.

806
00:45:29,749 --> 00:45:33,525
Kyoto? Ni nzuri.

807
00:45:33,548 --> 00:45:36,236
Ningependa pia kwenda.

808
00:45:36,260 --> 00:45:41,627
Mwalimu alisoma chuo kikuu kilichopo Kyoto.

809
00:45:41,650 --> 00:45:44,816
Kwa hiyo anapenda Kyoto sana.

810
00:45:44,839 --> 00:45:46,909
Sasa naelewa.

811
00:45:46,933 --> 00:45:51,466
Aa, mwalimu ametazama hapa na kutucheka.

812
00:45:51,489 --> 00:45:54,023
Eh, kweli?

813
00:45:54,046 --> 00:45:56,779
Nimeona aibu kidogo.

814
00:45:56,802 --> 00:45:59,335
Usijali, hakuna matata.

815
00:45:59,358 --> 00:46:01,558
Twende kumsalimia.

816
00:46:01,581 --> 00:46:06,048
Sasa anaongea na watu wengine, hatuwezi.

817
00:46:06,071 --> 00:46:07,804
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

818
00:46:07,827 --> 00:46:11,639
Tutangojea hapa mpaka atakapomaliza.

819
00:46:11,663 --> 00:46:16,863
Sawa. Aa, yule anayekula keki pale ni nani?

820
00:46:16,886 --> 00:46:20,552
Yule ni Mark.

821
00:46:20,575 --> 00:46:23,109
Daima anakula, sivyo?

822
00:46:23,132 --> 00:46:28,465
Hehe, Mark anapenda sana kula.

823
00:46:28,488 --> 00:46:33,288
Ndiyo, pia chakula anachotayarisha ni tamu sana.

824
00:46:33,311 --> 00:46:37,956
Ningependa kula chakula alichotayarisha Mark next time.

825
00:46:37,979 --> 00:46:42,312
Basi, next time tutafanya party pamoja.

826
00:46:42,335 --> 00:46:43,835
Mstari wa 22: Matatizo Kabla ya Mwisho wa Ripoti

827
00:46:43,835 --> 00:46:48,724
Mark, umewasilisha ripoti ile?

828
00:46:48,748 --> 00:46:53,435
Hapana, sijaanza kuandika bado.

829
00:46:53,458 --> 00:46:55,991
Eeh, kweli?

830
00:46:56,014 --> 00:46:58,912
Ni kesho asubuhi hadi wakati huo, sivyo?

831
00:46:58,936 --> 00:47:03,936
Ndiyo, nafahamu, lakini sijamaliza.

832
00:47:03,959 --> 00:47:05,935
Kwa nini?

833
00:47:05,958 --> 00:47:09,002
Ulikuwa na muda wa kutosha, sivyo?

834
00:47:09,026 --> 00:47:13,761
Kompyuta yangu ilivunjika na data zote zimefutika.

835
00:47:13,784 --> 00:47:16,793
Hiyo ilikuwa ngumu.

836
00:47:16,816 --> 00:47:19,149
Sasa iko sawa?

837
00:47:19,172 --> 00:47:25,187
Ndiyo, nimekopa kompyuta ya rafiki yangu na sasa ninaandika.

838
00:47:25,211 --> 00:47:27,611
Umeandika kiasi gani?

839
00:47:27,634 --> 00:47:29,867
Nusu hivi?

840
00:47:29,890 --> 00:47:34,457
Hapana, nimeandika kidogo tu.

841
00:47:34,480 --> 00:47:36,680
Nina wasiwasia.

842
00:47:36,703 --> 00:47:41,103
Utalazimika kufanya bidii hadi usiku wa manane.

843
00:47:41,126 --> 00:47:44,926
Ndiyo, sitaenda kulala leo, nitakwenda kuandika.

844
00:47:44,949 --> 00:47:47,515
Utaweza mwilini?

845
00:47:47,538 --> 00:47:50,338
Usijitwike sana, tafadhali.

846
00:47:50,361 --> 00:47:52,561
Asante sana.

847
00:47:52,584 --> 00:47:56,624
Lakini kama sitawasilisha, nitapata matatizo.

848
00:47:56,648 --> 00:48:00,421
Umeomba mtu yeyote kukagua kanji?

849
00:48:00,445 --> 00:48:04,845
Hapana, sijamwomba mtu yeyote bado.

850
00:48:04,868 --> 00:48:08,736
Basi, naweza kukusaidia?

851
00:48:08,759 --> 00:48:11,359
Eh, kweli?

852
00:48:11,382 --> 00:48:13,749
Nitashukuru sana.

853
00:48:13,772 --> 00:48:17,744
Nionyeshe sehemu uliyomaliza.

854
00:48:17,768 --> 00:48:19,737
Sawa, nimeelewa.

855
00:48:19,760 --> 00:48:23,832
Lakini sijamaliza hata ukurasa mmoja.

856
00:48:23,855 --> 00:48:26,388
Haraka upesi.

857
00:48:26,411 --> 00:48:29,296
Wakati unaendelea haraka.

858
00:48:29,320 --> 00:48:33,939
Ndiyo, nitaanza kubonyeza haraka sasa hivi.

859
00:48:33,963 --> 00:48:37,234
Umekwisha kula chakula cha jioni?

860
00:48:37,257 --> 00:48:41,424
Hapana, sijala chochote bado.

861
00:48:41,446 --> 00:48:43,784
Nina njaa.

862
00:48:43,807 --> 00:48:48,974
Basi, nitakwenda kununua kitu chochote kwenye duka la karibu.

863
00:48:48,997 --> 00:48:50,397
Samahani

864
00:48:50,421 --> 00:48:53,388
Niletee onigiri mbili, tafadhali.

865
00:48:53,411 --> 00:48:55,491
Sawa, nimeelewa.

866
00:48:55,514 --> 00:48:57,985
Nitakununua chai pia.

867
00:48:58,009 --> 00:48:59,648
Asante sana.

868
00:48:59,671 --> 00:49:02,684
Nitakulipa baadaye.

869
00:49:02,708 --> 00:49:04,641
Sawa tu.

870
00:49:04,664 --> 00:49:07,513
Kwanza, jitahidi kwenye ripoti.

871
00:49:07,536 --> 00:49:09,349
Ndiyo.

872
00:49:09,373 --> 00:49:14,551
Nina bahati sana kuwa na mwenzangu mzuri kama wewe.

873
00:49:14,574 --> 00:49:16,449
Ahaa, sawa.

874
00:49:16,473 --> 00:49:19,906
Usinifuate, jitahidi tu.

875
00:49:19,929 --> 00:49:21,938
Sawa, nimeelewa.

876
00:49:21,962 --> 00:49:24,695
Nitakaza bidii.

877
00:49:24,718 --> 00:49:26,218
Mstari wa 23: Mazungumzo ya Chaguo la Chakula

878
00:49:26,218 --> 00:49:29,418
Kuna chaguo nyingi kwenye menyu hii.

879
00:49:29,441 --> 00:49:31,508
Utachagua ipi?

880
00:49:31,530 --> 00:49:33,697
Ndiyo, kweli.

881
00:49:33,720 --> 00:49:39,153
Nashindwa kati ya nyama na samaki.

882
00:49:39,177 --> 00:49:44,510
Unapenda nini zaidi kati ya nyama na samaki?

883
00:49:44,533 --> 00:49:48,791
Napenda nyama zaidi kuliko samaki.

884
00:49:48,815 --> 00:49:52,582
Basi, hii gyūdon (chakula cha nyama ya ng'ombe) itakuwaje?

885
00:49:52,605 --> 00:49:54,872
Inaonekana nzuri.

886
00:49:54,895 --> 00:49:57,262
Sawa sana!

887
00:49:57,285 --> 00:50:00,618
Hii seti ya samaki itakuwaje?

888
00:50:00,641 --> 00:50:06,374
Samaki ni nzuri kwa afya, kwa hiyo ni maarufu sana.

889
00:50:06,397 --> 00:50:08,997
Ungependelea upi?

890
00:50:09,020 --> 00:50:10,894
Umeamua tayari?

891
00:50:10,918 --> 00:50:15,051
Mimi nitachagua karai ya kuku hii.

892
00:50:15,074 --> 00:50:18,074
Napenda vyakula vyenye pilipili kali.

893
00:50:18,097 --> 00:50:20,503
Karai pia ni nzuri.

894
00:50:20,527 --> 00:50:23,410
Harufu yake inafika hapa.

895
00:50:23,434 --> 00:50:27,567
Kati ya udon na soba, unapendelea ipi?

896
00:50:27,590 --> 00:50:31,323
Mimi napendelea soba zaidi.

897
00:50:31,346 --> 00:50:34,080
Napenda sana soba baridi.

898
00:50:34,103 --> 00:50:38,070
Dukani hapa, soba zao pia ni maarufu sana.

899
00:50:38,093 --> 00:50:40,528
Walikuwa wanasema ni tamu.

900
00:50:40,552 --> 00:50:43,490
Aa, kweli ndivyo?

901
00:50:43,513 --> 00:50:46,925
Sasa nina shida zaidi katika kuchagua.

902
00:50:46,948 --> 00:50:49,882
Chukua muda wako.

903
00:50:49,905 --> 00:50:52,381
Tuna muda.

904
00:50:52,405 --> 00:50:58,005
Kwenye duka hili, ni bora juisi ya tufaa au ya chungwa?

905
00:50:58,028 --> 00:51:02,761
Mimi napendelea juisi ya tufaa kwa sababu ni tamu zaidi.

906
00:51:02,784 --> 00:51:06,751
Basi, mimi nitachagua juisi ya chungwa.

907
00:51:06,774 --> 00:51:09,340
Napenda vitu vyenye uchachu.

908
00:51:09,363 --> 00:51:14,232
Tunatofautiana sana katika mapendeleo ya ladha.

909
00:51:14,255 --> 00:51:16,111
Ni ya kufurahisha.

910
00:51:16,135 --> 00:51:21,511
Ndiyo, kwa hiyo ni furaha kula pamoja.

911
00:51:21,535 --> 00:51:23,168
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

912
00:51:23,191 --> 00:51:27,391
Aa, samahani, tafadhali chukua agizo letu.

913
00:51:27,414 --> 00:51:31,547
Aa, mimi sijamaliza kuchagua bado.

914
00:51:31,570 --> 00:51:34,337
Aa, pole.

915
00:51:34,360 --> 00:51:38,160
Lazima uamue upesi, mhudumu anakuja.

916
00:51:38,183 --> 00:51:42,659
Basi, nitachagua gyūdon ya kwanza.

917
00:51:42,682 --> 00:51:45,572
Nina njaa sana.

918
00:51:45,596 --> 00:51:48,267
Umeamua chakula cha nyama, basi.

919
00:51:48,290 --> 00:51:49,979
Sawa, nzuri.

920
00:51:50,003 --> 00:51:54,970
Ndiyo, bado ninataka kula nyama nyingi.

921
00:51:54,993 --> 00:52:00,033
Kwenye seti hii, kuna supu ya miso, na hiyo ni furaha.

922
00:52:00,056 --> 00:52:05,941
Ndiyo, supu moto ni nzuri kwa mwili.

923
00:52:05,964 --> 00:52:09,964
Tuzungumze kuhusu mpango wa kesho hadi chakula kitumike.

924
00:52:09,987 --> 00:52:14,405
Sawa, kesho tutaondoka saa ngapi?

925
00:52:14,429 --> 00:52:15,929
Sehemu ya 24: Kumbukumbu za Mwaka

926
00:52:15,929 --> 00:52:20,362
Karibu darasa letu litaisha hivi karibuni.

927
00:52:20,386 --> 00:52:22,152
Ninahuzunika.

928
00:52:22,175 --> 00:52:24,192
Ndiyo, kweli.

929
00:52:24,216 --> 00:52:29,016
Mwaka mzima umeenda haraka sana, kweli.

930
00:52:29,039 --> 00:52:34,872
Msimu gani ulikuwa wa kufurahisha zaidi mwaka huu?

931
00:52:34,895 --> 00:52:41,128
Mimi nilifurahia zaidi majira ya autumn, pia ilikuwa nzuri sana.

932
00:52:41,151 --> 00:52:43,085
Majira ya autumn?

933
00:52:43,108 --> 00:52:46,766
Kwa nini unapenda zaidi majira ya autumn?

934
00:52:46,789 --> 00:52:51,646
Tulikwenda pamoja mlimani kuona majani mekundu.

935
00:52:51,670 --> 00:52:55,121
Aa, safari ile.

936
00:52:55,144 --> 00:52:58,115
Picha nyingi zipo.

937
00:52:58,139 --> 00:53:04,577
Ndiyo, siku ile hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri, na hakukuwa na baridi kabisa.

938
00:53:04,600 --> 00:53:09,233
Ni tukio gani lililokuwa kumbukumbu yako bora zaidi?

939
00:53:09,257 --> 00:53:14,624
Mimi nilikazika sana katika mashindano ya hotuba majira ya baridi.

940
00:53:14,647 --> 00:53:20,454
Aa, wakati huo tulikuwa tunafanya mazoezi kila siku.

941
00:53:20,477 --> 00:53:27,717
Ndiyo, mimi ndiye niliyesoma sentensi ndefu zaidi darasani.

942
00:53:27,740 --> 00:53:32,274
Hatupewi tuzo, lakini nilifanya vizuri sana.

943
00:53:32,297 --> 00:53:33,988
Asante sana.

944
00:53:34,012 --> 00:53:36,845
Kimekuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.

945
00:53:36,868 --> 00:53:42,201
Katika masomo uliyoyasomea, ni nini kilichokuwa vigumu zaidi?

946
00:53:42,224 --> 00:53:47,358
Nadhani keigo (heshima) ndiyo iliyokuwa vigumu zaidi.

947
00:53:47,381 --> 00:53:53,320
Hata Wajapani wenyewe wanakosea keigo, ni ngumu sana.

948
00:53:53,343 --> 00:54:00,029
Lakini, mwalimu Tanaka alikuza kwa njia rahisi zaidi kuelewa.

949
00:54:00,053 --> 00:54:01,453
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

950
00:54:01,476 --> 00:54:06,010
Mwalimu Tanaka daima alikuwa mpole.

951
00:54:06,033 --> 00:54:11,366
Kati ya marafiki wako darasani, uliwahutubia zaidi nani?

952
00:54:11,389 --> 00:54:16,189
